i di protezione individuale possono trasformarsi rapidamente in situazioni pericolose. Imparate a riconoscere tempestivamente i pericoli e ad agire in modo sicuro.", "short_description": "Scoprite la sicurezza sul lavoro nell'edilizia in legno in modo virtuale e realistico: riconoscere i rischi tipici, reagire correttamente, senza alcun pericolo di lesioni. Imparate a evitare errori e a utilizzare in modo sicuro utensili e moduli."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Querformat.png", "id": "1735425970481901", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821696_1735425973815234_7026648888461368653_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kIILKJ7UNjoQ7kNvwEfRx-6&_nc_oc=AdqqZ1x64F8xQx-W9w3UCTGKRyFCTTXqsZukzdk99aznFs7VGQHZWn_RpXgu6cjxGhc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQM10KACoTQ0S9WVkSjL8MwqPkYKEpr1SGmNaUFb6mK0jg&oe=6ADF5123"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1404469407857988", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491819845_1404469411191321_2374008257608234867_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=yy6ZdOdvRpMQ7kNvwEjaRpu&_nc_oc=AdpG5jsATpxPw-CuU6Z7ky8lsPz1q81JiRe2lRURUt86owCP9y4NMxVeL98qFz88bic&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMq5ZgvNq302tgBU2WL8wZJ9zgzziu6mYFbwL_r6OhmsQ&oe=6ADF755D"}, {"file_name": "WoodConstructionCover - Hochformat.png", "id": "1138371601691473", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822307_1138371605024806_6545105809583793091_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=oEUBu1F31uwQ7kNvwG8XAIB&_nc_oc=Adq_iO-GCSYKuoThg_gCYlwpMZbdTWT3jiCsj2Cag3Ni_AfxsdCW-vOrzJpNzChQl9Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMJ64sg3R6bSoXtk1Rl1Qn7-YQ6R1N5Dpq2_fGmlvEFZA&oe=6ADF63CA"}, {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1061729109131103", "im